.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":422,"height":422}},"text":"We start by reviewing how your website currently performs across search, AI visibility, content, technical health and user experience. This helps us understand where your brand is already showing up and where competitors are stealing the conversation.","duration":"1 day","weekNumber":1,"workInvolved":[{"item":"SEO review"},{"item":"AI & GEO visibility checks"},{"item":"Content review"},{"item":"Technical health check"},{"item":"Competitor visibility review"},{"item":"Analytics review"},{"item":"Priority recommendations"}]},{"heading":"Growth strategy","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/timeline-1.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":422,"height":422}},"text":"Next, we turn the findings into a focused plan. We identify the opportunities most likely to move the needle, from content improvements and AI search optimisation to technical fixes, blog planning and website enhancements.\r\n","duration":"1 day","weekNumber":1,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Growth roadmap"},{"item":"SEO priorities"},{"item":"GEO recommendations"},{"item":"Content opportunities"},{"item":"Technical priorities"},{"item":"Measurement framework"},{"item":"Monthly activity plan"}]},{"heading":"Content & copywriting","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/timeline-1.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":422,"height":422}},"text":"Strong visibility needs strong content. We create website copy, landing page content and ongoing blog articles that help your audience understand what you do, why it matters and why your brand deserves to be found.","duration":"Ongoing","weekNumber":null,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Website copywriting"},{"item":"Blog writing"},{"item":"SEO content planning"},{"item":"Content optimisation"},{"item":"Metadata"},{"item":"Internal linking"},{"item":"AI search considerations"}]},{"heading":"AI & GEO support package","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/timeline-1.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":422,"height":422}},"text":"AI search is changing how people discover, compare and choose brands. We help structure your content, strengthen your authority signals and improve the clarity of your website so LLMs and AI search platforms can better understand what you do.","duration":"Ongoing","weekNumber":null,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Monthly SEO performance reviews"},{"item":"GEO recommendations"},{"item":"Structured content guidance"},{"item":"Entity & authority signals"},{"item":"FAQ optimisation"},{"item":"Content refreshes"},{"item":"Search intent mapping"},{"item":"Ongoing visibility monitoring"}]},{"heading":"SiteCare website support ","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/timeline-1.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":422,"height":422}},"text":"Your website should keep improving after launch. Through our SiteCare package, we support the technical health, stability and performance of your site, while identifying opportunities to improve speed, usability and conversion over time.\r\n","duration":"Ongoing","weekNumber":null,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Website maintenance"},{"item":"Security updates"},{"item":"Performance monitoring"},{"item":"Bug fixes"},{"item":"CMS support"},{"item":"Hosting support"},{"item":"Ongoing improvements"}]}]}}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Testimonials_testimonials__J0bdm","children":[["$","$L10",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"Testimonials_heading__q4vc3","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"children":"What our clients say."}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Testimonials_testimonialDesktop__XClcG","children":["$","$L24",null,{"testimonials":[{"text":"\"Beyond the initial launch, KOTA have continued to support us over the past 12 months with ongoing SEO, helping us b